{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Berdly — from villain to ally\n\nSecondary antagonist of Ch.2, Queen's ally. Decisive in defeating her. His arc depends mostly on how the player treats Noelle throughout the chapter.","x":-180,"y":-70,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nHis only real friend since childhood; he relies on her to study more than he admits in public.","x":346,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Queen**\nAlly in Ch.2 to build 'Smartopia'; she ends up controlling him by force once it gets out of hand.","x":164,"y":294,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"4"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Susie**\nHe falls for her after she assures him she doesn't care whether he's smart or dumb — he nicknames her 'Gamer Girl.'","x":-424,"y":294,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**What is he hiding about his paralyzed arm?**\nIn Ch.4 he mentions having a theory of his own that he dismisses as 'irrational,' without explaining it.","x":-606,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Berdly_overworld_frozen.png","x":-129,"y":-928,"width":125,"height":190},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld_Berdly_shake.gif","x":707,"y":-361,"width":178,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Berdly_joining_queen.png","x":416,"y":573,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":-675,"y":555,"width":108,"height":190},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Berdly_overworld_broken_arm.png","x":-606,"y":-463,"width":95,"height":190},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Berdly_battle_intro.gif","x":-125,"y":-215,"width":259,"height":145},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Rare Route — Snowgrave**\nFrozen by Noelle with SnowGrave in Ch.2; can remain comatose in the hospital throughout Ch.4 if the route stays active.","x":-66,"y":-633,"width":270,"height":170,"color":"4"},{"id":"1396a7b7e134bd2f","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Berdly_overworld_hospital_comatose.png","x":135,"y":-928,"width":119,"height":182}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"bottom","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"839fea810672e7df","fromNode":"1396a7b7e134bd2f","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"cross_snowgrave_noelle","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s1","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_queen_brazo","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_susie_noelle","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_snowgrave_brazo","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"}]}